OL,3,GNEWSAKiller teen who adopted 'gangster
OL,4,Apersonality' jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who adopted a "gangster
OL,7,Fpersonality" has been jailed for at
OL,8,Fleast 14 years for the murder of a
OL,9,F16-year-old boy over a #20 cannabis
OL,10,Fdebt.
OL,12,FJoshua Ingram was attacked with a 19cm
OL,13,F(7.5 inch) combat-style knife at
OL,14,FSeaford railway station in East Sussex
OL,15,Fon 10 September, 2025.
OL,17,FAt Hove Crown Court on Friday, Joshua's
OL,18,Fkiller, who cannot be named due to his
OL,19,Fage, was told he must serve a minimum
OL,20,Fterm of 14 years, and will be on
OL,21,Flicence for the rest of his life.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
